00:00:11,585 --> 00:00:15,521
This week's reading is called Shmini Atzeret, drawn

6
00:00:15,553 --> 00:00:19,441
from Deuteronomy chapters fourteen through sixteen, and it's

7
00:00:19,498 --> 00:00:21,521
