42
00:02:10,125 --> 00:02:13,085
If you fail to tithe properly, God will

43
00:02:13,149 --> 00:02:15,965
send the scorching east wind to blast the

44
00:02:16,045 --> 00:02:17,645
crops before they ripen.

45
00:02:17,912 --> 00:02:22,605
So the juxtaposition itself carries a warning: faithfulness

46
00:02:22,658 --> 00:02:25,725
