150
00:07:14,364 --> 00:07:15,507
called to give.

151
00:07:15,727 --> 00:07:18,867
His reading of the servant laws insists on

152
00:07:18,967 --> 00:07:22,307
dignity and generosity that goes far beyond the

153
00:07:22,367 --> 00:07:22,947
minimum.

154
00:07:23,107 --> 00:07:25,907
And his treatment of the festivals reminds us

155
00:07:25,939 --> 00:07:28,787
