156
00:07:28,887 --> 00:07:30,147
but a commitment.

157
00:07:30,263 --> 00:07:35,187
Throughout, Rashi demonstrates his signature method: using small

158
00:07:35,257 --> 00:07:39,347
textual details, a repeated word, an unusual grammatical

159
00:07:39,459 --> 00:07:43,827
form, an apparent contradiction, to unlock large moral

160
00:07:44,187 --> 00:07:45,587
truths.

161
00:07:45,667 --> 00:07:48,237
For Rashi, the Torah's laws are never merely

162
00:07:48,309 --> 00:07:49,037
