163
00:07:49,133 --> 00:07:51,677
They are windows into what it means to

164
00:07:51,741 --> 00:07:55,117
live in genuine relationship with God and with

165
00:07:55,177 --> 00:07:59,284
one another.Thank you so much for joining me

166
00:07:59,364 --> 00:08:00,644
